Origin of the Term

• Headshrinker: The word comes from "headshrinker," a 20th-century slang term that humorously or derisively compared therapists to tribal headhunters (such as the Jivaroan peoples of the Amazon) who preserved shrunken heads. [1] (/goto?url=CAEShQEB6zswFSyPi9IOpTcvvsY2pHlvwdhhg4HLe3PPCbXTVu-b1NgFeupJYMJbTagIJst6lzP8NbMkaczi5yCj-kIMZw1myedNKd11q8H7Z_T4tyqGfwDZ0r9TGG6eccik34UNaCo3-Nf1pKWP2s5hk0FBvjKsgTzQnX87fs_OI5-lOth6ESDt), [2] (/goto?url=CAESjgEB6zswFVSogaspjvUBzm_c6-SGDY_U4J12ICk60tQfH0GgKuvd3k5teK9Itv9MRZnHSF_VfVwPyCGKMRI0fHPrXS2duxlXbTbaU4xE4WtSmYFOBA6eHjVATt_EXyfQXaQ_GkLAYndmDy4PMCalNpytg4nerJX1osd4dH_qORMV-gdyTjZ2W5FftLL4Kkrt)
